The mechanism ends selected width-8 helpers on certified hyperplanes, changing their residual width to 7 and pairing them with width-9 owner slots. It is mass-neutral and leaves the rank deficit unchanged while improving the paid profile. The independent run took 272.5001600839896 seconds from a fresh baseline.

The certificate and receipt auditor are in `certificates/frontier-20261012-591.json` and `certificates/pr591-independent-replay/`. PR591's original provenance and AI disclosure are retained: Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic) performed the submitted construction; this independent replay and certificate were prepared with OpenAI Codex assistance.

The claim remains conditional on the inherited all-size compiler, common-label/mutable-source realization, whole-call hosting, precision/tape/exact recovery, and analytic transfer. It is not an unconditional theorem or full Lean certification.
